      "imprint_publisher": "Zenodo",
      "notes": "This paper does not claim a derivation of standard momentum, standard energy, or standard mass. The tested result is internal to the Wave Information Readout series: p_read, E_read, R_read, R*p, and R*p^2 can be consistently constructed as conserved readouts from multigauge interference in the tested ABC closed phase system.",
